# LayerFlow V2 — Rebuild Plan (10 Phases)

> This file converts the 60-phase V2 rebuild brief into 10 executable phases.
> Every one of the 60 phases is mapped — nothing dropped (map at the bottom).
> Status legend: ✅ done · 🚧 in progress · ⏳ queued · ❌ gap found

## Audit verdict (2026-08-31, full-repo deep audit)

The codebase is **far more real than it looked**. "Nothing works" was traced to
three concrete causes, not missing wiring:

1. **Dead provider keys + no call timeout.** Every configured platform key is
   out of credits or misconfigured (OpenAI 429 no-credits, DeepSeek 402, Kimi
   429 suspended, xAI 403 no-credits, Gemini POST hangs from this network).
   Provider calls had **no timeout**, so a hanging Gemini call blocked chat
   forever instead of failing over. The only working key (Groq) was pointed at
   `llama-3.3-70b-versatile`, which Groq removed from the account (404).
2. **Terminal TUI streaming bug.** The Bubble Tea stream pump fires once and
   never re-arms — TUI chat stalls after the first token; toasts never render.
3. **A handful of fake UI surfaces** (Models hub fiction catalog, Billing
   hardcoded plans/invoices, Settings cosmetic saves, prompt sub-scores) while
   everything else (chat, agents, search, memory, costs, keys, team) is wired
   to the real API.

Evidence-backed feature matrix (from the audit):

| Area | Backend | Frontend | Terminal | Real? |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Auth (email/Google/device/API-key) | REAL | WIRED | WIRED | ✅ |
| Chat sessions + SSE streaming + failover | REAL | WIRED | TUI pump broken | ✅/🚧 |
| Model routing AUTO + key health + failover | REAL (no timeout) | picker static list | `/v1/models` live | 🚧 |
| Gateway `/v1` OpenAI-compatible | REAL | — | WIRED (CLI) | ✅ |
| Budgets (Redis Lua reserve/settle) + usage ledger | REAL | WIRED | `lf cost` WIRED | ✅ |
| Agents: templates, runs, approvals, schedules | REAL (no tools) | WIRED | not exposed | 🚧 |
| Agent tool framework (read/write/shell/browser) | **MISSING** | — | built but **dead code** | ❌ |
| Artifacts / structured output / PDF | **MISSING** | — | — | ❌ |
| Memory (pgvector + extraction job) | REAL | WIRED | schema broken (never init) | ✅/❌ |
| Hybrid search | REAL (prompts+sessions) | WIRED | FTS never built | 🚧 |
| Files (local disk + R2 presigned) | REAL | upload in agent builder | — | ✅ |
| Billing (Dodo) + plan limits | REAL (unconfigured = beta mode) | page shows fake plans | — | 🚧 |
| CLI↔Web sync | push REAL (bad JSON tags) | — | pull is a no-op | ❌ |
| Community/team/learning/admin | REAL | WIRED | — | ✅ |
| Rescue/improve/compare | REAL | WIRED | `lf rescue` export | ✅ |

