## Reference products (rules)

Study opencode + cline for interaction patterns ONLY (tools, approvals, sessions,
agent loops, terminal UX). Own branding, own architecture, own model abstraction.
No proprietary assets, no source copying, no feature duplication.

## Working order (strict)

Phase 1 → 2 → 3 (these unlock everything) → 6 terminal critical bugs (small,
huge UX win) → 4 → 8 (web truth) → 5 (agents, biggest build) → 7 → 9 → 10.
Critical before optional. No fake success states. Every phase ends with
typecheck + tests + a real end-to-end verification.
